  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你不觉得视线这东西很可怕吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D89C95F9789C67EBF8FD94E1C897F5F8853EF60155417FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "的确很可怕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7684786E5F8853EF60150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么了吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E484E865417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有件事想请你帮忙……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167094EF64E8B60F38BF74F605E2E5FD92026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家隔壁住着一个\n从帕底亚搬来的人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB6969458C14F4F77404E004E2A000A4ECE5E155E954E9A642C676576844EBA300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个人带着的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A4EBA5E26774076845B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它总是一直盯着\n我家可爱的巨钳螳螂看！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83603B662F4E0076F476EF7740000A62115BB653EF723176845DE894B387B38782770BFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为巨钳螳螂有点胆小，\n所以它每天都在害怕呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A5DE894B387B38782670970B980C65C0FFF0C000A62404EE55B836BCF592990FD57285BB360155462FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想知道邻居家的宝可梦……\n巧锻匠它一直盯着巨钳螳螂看是要做什么。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n请你帮我调查一下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F377E5905390BB5C455BB676845B9D53EF68A620262026000A5DE7953B53205B834E0076F476EF77405DE894B387B38782770B662F8981505A4EC04E48300200100001BE00000A8BF74F605E2E62118C0367E54E004E0B5427FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀切……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54805207202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我猜隔壁那人现在应该是在屋顶上。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211731C969458C190A34EBA73B057285E948BE5662F57285C4B98764E0A300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个……\n你有什么事吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A20262026000A4F6067094EC04E484E8B5417FF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧锻匠的事",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7953B532076844E8B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨钳螳螂的事",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE894B387B3878276844E8B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n你是说隔壁那位的宝可梦吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A4F60662F8BF4969458C190A34F4D76845B9D53EF68A65427300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧锻匠一直在盯着巨钳螳螂看，\n这是事实没错。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7953B53204E0076F4572876EF77405DE894B387B38782770BFF0C000A8FD9662F4E8B5B9E6CA19519300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隔壁那位的巨钳螳螂，\n该说是眼神凶恶还是可怕呢……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n会盯着看是因为在提防它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "969458C190A34F4D76845DE894B387B38782FF0C000A8BE58BF4662F773C795E51F660768FD8662F53EF601554622026202600100001BE00000A4F1A76EF7740770B662F56E04E3A572863D096325B83300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实就只是这样而已，\n不过被一声不吭地盯着看确实挺可怕的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E5C3153EA662F8FD96837800C5DF2FF0C000A4E0D8FC788AB4E0058F04E0D542D573076EF7740770B786E5B9E633A53EF60157684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家，如果你不介意，\n请把刚才这些话告诉隔壁那位吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C5982679C4F604E0D4ECB610FFF0C000A8BF7628A521A624D8FD94E9B8BDD544A8BC9969458C190A34F4D5427300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以隔壁的巧锻匠\n为什么要盯着巨钳螳螂看呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5969458C176845DE7953B5320000A4E3A4EC04E48898176EF77405DE894B387B38782770B5440FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨钳螳螂的眼神",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE894B387B387827684773C795E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨钳螳螂很可怕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE894B387B387825F8853EF60150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？因为巨钳螳螂的眼神很可怕，\n所以才会盯着它看……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F56E04E3A5DE894B387B387827684773C795E5F8853EF6015FF0C000A62404EE5624D4F1A76EF77405B83770B2026202600100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？\n它在提防巨钳螳螂？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F000A5B83572863D096325DE894B387B38782FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那还真是不好意思，\n巨钳螳螂本来就是这样的眼神。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A38FD8771F662F4E0D597D610F601DFF0C000A5DE894B387B38782672C67655C31662F8FD968377684773C795E300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算对方说是在提防它……\n被一声不吭地盯着看也很可怕啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B975BF965B98BF4662F572863D096325B8320262026000A88AB4E0058F04E0D542D573076EF7740770B4E5F5F8853EF6015554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才不要因为刚搬来的\n不怎么熟悉的人和宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而失去现在的平静生活！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D4E0D898156E04E3A521A642C67657684000A4E0D600E4E48719F608976844EBA548C5B9D53EF68A600100001BE00000A800C593153BB73B0572876845E739759751F6D3BFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且不是说巧锻匠会为了\n收集金属而袭击其他宝可梦嘛。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n难道说是因为巨钳螳螂\n是钢属性，所以才……？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E144E0D662F8BF45DE7953B53204F1A4E3A4E86000A653696C691D15C5E800C88AD51FB51764ED65B9D53EF68A6561B300200100001BE01000A96BE90538BF4662F56E04E3A5DE894B387B38782000A662F94A25C5E6027FF0C62404EE5624D20262026FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀……！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548020262026FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放心吧，巨钳螳螂！\n万一出什么事情，我会保护你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E5FC35427FF0C5DE894B387B38782FF01000A4E074E0051FA4EC04E484E8B60C5FF0C62114F1A4FDD62A44F607684300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "除非能确定隔壁住的人可以让人放心，\n不然可没法消除巨钳螳螂的不安呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9664975E80FD786E5B9A969458C14F4F76844EBA53EF4EE58BA94EBA653E5FC3FF0C000A4E0D713653EF6CA16CD56D8896645DE894B387B3878276844E0D5B895440FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隔壁那位刚搬过来，\n应该也很不容易，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要是你能帮我和对方说清楚就太好了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "969458C190A34F4D521A642C8FC76765FF0C000A5E948BE54E5F5F884E0D5BB96613FF0C00100001BE00000A8981662F4F6080FD5E2E6211548C5BF965B98BF46E05695A5C31592A597D4E86300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5480202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隔壁那位怎么说？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "969458C190A34F4D600E4E488BF4FF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被盯着看很可怕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB76EF7740770B5F8853EF60150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧锻匠很可怕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7953B53205F8853EF60150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是这样啊，\n原来隔壁那位是这么说的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8FD96837554AFF0C000A539F6765969458C190A34F4D662F8FD94E488BF47684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧锻匠明明是个好孩子，\n什么都不了解就说它可怕，太过分了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7953B5320660E660E662F4E2A597D5B695B50FF0C000A4EC04E4890FD4E0D4E8689E35C318BF45B8353EF6015FF0C592A8FC752064E86FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家的巧锻匠\n才不会为了收集金属<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而去袭击其他宝可梦呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB676845DE7953B5320000A624D4E0D4F1A4E3A4E86653696C691D15C5E00100001BE00000A800C53BB88AD51FB51764ED65B9D53EF68A65462300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……几乎不会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202651E04E4E4E0D4F1A300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们也才刚搬过来，心里很不踏实呢。\n莫名其妙就觉得我家宝可梦可怕，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n该怎么说呢，我们也会很困扰的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E5F624D521A642C8FC76765FF0C5FC391CC5F884E0D8E0F5B9E54623002000A83AB540D517659995C3189C95F9762115BB65B9D53EF68A653EF6015FF0C00100001BE00000A8BE5600E4E488BF45462FF0C62114EEC4E5F4F1A5F8856F062707684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我倒是希望隔壁那位也能证明一下，\n巨钳螳螂真的没有在瞪着我们。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115012662F5E0C671B969458C190A34F4D4E5F80FD8BC1660E4E004E0BFF0C000A5DE894B387B38782771F76846CA16709572877AA774062114EEC300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561F202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隔壁那位怎么说？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "969458C190A34F4D600E4E488BF4FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想知道有没有被巨钳螳螂瞪着",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F377E5905367096CA1670988AB5DE894B387B3878277AA77400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望你们不用担心被巧锻匠袭击",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B4F604EEC4E0D752862C55FC388AB5DE7953B532088AD51FB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胆小的巨钳螳螂\n怎么可能会瞪着他们看啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80C65C0F76845DE894B387B38782000A600E4E4853EF80FD4F1A77AA77404ED64EEC770B554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘴上想怎么说就怎么说，\n又不是说不袭击就不会袭击。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56344E0A60F3600E4E488BF45C31600E4E488BF4FF0C000A53C84E0D662F8BF44E0D88AD51FB5C314E0D4F1A88AD51FB300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确实，我能理解隔壁的人\n在不熟悉的土地上会有很多不安。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我们可是从以前就一直住在这里啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E5B9EFF0C621180FD740689E3969458C176844EBA000A57284E0D719F60897684571F57304E0A4F1A67095F88591A4E0D5B89300200100001BE00000A4F4662114EEC53EF662F4ECE4EE5524D5C314E0076F44F4F57288FD991CC554AFF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那好吧！\n我会证明巨钳螳螂没有在瞪他们。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3597D5427FF01000A62114F1A8BC1660E5DE894B387B387826CA16709572877AA4ED64EEC300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么证明？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E488BC1660EFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能做到吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD505A52305417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想让巨钳螳螂和巧锻匠见个面。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38BA95DE894B387B38782548C5DE7953B532089C14E2A9762300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟只要有你这位训练家\n在一旁陪同，我就能放心。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF53EA898167094F608FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6000A57284E0065C1966A540CFF0C62115C3180FD653E5FC3300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要隔壁的人没有异议，\n我们就让两只宝可梦见面吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981969458C176844EBA6CA167095F028BAEFF0C000A62114EEC5C318BA94E2453EA5B9D53EF68A689C197625427FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀恰恰。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54806070607030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让巧锻匠和巨钳螳螂见个面……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA95DE7953B5320548C5DE894B387B3878289C14E2A97622026202600100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5427FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟有人提防我和巧锻匠这件事，\n对于我们来说会成为压力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF67094EBA63D096326211548C5DE7953B53208FD94EF64E8BFF0C000A5BF94E8E62114EEC67658BF44F1A62104E3A538B529B300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们也想证明一下\n巧锻匠是不会袭击巨钳螳螂的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E5F60F38BC1660E4E004E0B000A5DE7953B5320662F4E0D4F1A88AD51FB5DE894B387B387827684300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没事的啦，巧锻匠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA14E8B76845566FF0C5DE7953B5320300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿E",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下来就要让\n我们双方的宝可梦见面了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B67655C3189818BA9000A62114EEC53CC65B976845B9D53EF68A689C197624E86300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果有什么情况，\n就立刻让宝可梦回到球里好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C67094EC04E4860C551B5FF0C000A5C317ACB523B8BA95B9D53EF68A656DE5230740391CC597D4E86300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就来吧，巨钳螳螂！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3167655427FF0C5DE894B387B38782FF0100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "过来吧，巧锻匠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FC767655427FF0C5DE7953B5320300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巧锻匠是在害羞吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE7953B5320662F57285BB37F9E5417FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨钳螳螂是在害怕吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE894B387B38782662F57285BB360155417FF1F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561F266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀切……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54805207202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过巧锻匠没有袭击过来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC75DE7953B53206CA1670988AD51FB8FC76765300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨钳螳螂也只是眼神看起来凶恶……\n看来是彼此误会对方了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE894B387B387824E5F53EA662F773C795E770B8D77676551F6607620262026000A770B6765662F5F7C6B648BEF4F1A5BF965B94E86554A300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀切！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54805207FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "两只宝可梦的距离好像拉近一些了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2453EA5B9D53EF68A676848DDD79BB597D50CF62C98FD14E004E9B4E865440300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊。我们才刚来到密阿雷，\n有很多事情还不知道，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n如果遇到什么问题还请多帮忙啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 4092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A300262114EEC624D521A676552305BC6963F96F7FF0C000A67095F88591A4E8B60C58FD84E0D77E59053FF0C00100001BE00000A5982679C904752304EC04E4895EE98988FD88BF7591A5E2E5FD95566300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家，\n谢谢你今天帮了这么多忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 4188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A8C228C224F604ECA59295E2E4E868FD94E48591A5FD9300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！巧锻匠，\n不可以扒掉那边的金属！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF015DE7953B5320FF0C000A4E0D53EF4EE56252638990A38FB9768491D15C5EFF01FF0100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真、真的没问题吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 4284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F3001771F76846CA195EE98985417FF1F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀恰恰……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548060706070202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿Y",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和冶蕾萝\n最近也聊了很多事情。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巨钳螳螂和巧锻匠\n也相处得不错……至少目前还不错。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 4344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C51B6857E841D000A67008FD14E5F804A4E865F88591A4E8B60C5300200100001BE01000A5DE894B387B38782548C5DE7953B5320000A4E5F76F859045F974E0D95192026202681F35C1176EE524D8FD84E0D9519300200100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咀切～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54805207FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希司佐最近和我说了很多\n密阿雷的事情哦！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巧锻匠也总是\n和巨钳螳螂黏在一起。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C53F84F5067008FD1548C62118BF44E865F88591A000A5BC6963F96F776844E8B60C554E6FF0100100001BE01000A5DE7953B53204E5F603B662F000A548C5DE894B387B387829ECF57284E008D77300200100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵嘟！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 4544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9535561FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
